  "goodToKnow": "Der Aufsteiger is a newly promoted team in sport: Der Aufsteiger schlägt den Rekordmeister. Its opposite is der Absteiger (relegated team). More broadly, it's someone who has moved up: ein sozialer Aufsteiger, der Aufsteiger des Jahres. German debates about Bildungsaufsteiger (people who are the first in their family to go to university) focus on how much school success depends on parents. From aufsteigen (to rise, be promoted)."
